Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to sit alone for a while, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Long day. I'm not up for talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my period.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've a son of 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I spend my days cleaning toilets in the subway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother's an old hag who poisons my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's gay and jealous of all my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'm not in the mood for flirting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So I think you'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, your persistence is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I overdid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're cute, but I'm really beat today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Another time, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
